/a>. There are <a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a> of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Dagger\">Silver Dagger</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potions</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Runes</a> inside the chests on the second floor. West of that room is the entrance to a small sewer with Cyclopes and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rats</a>.<br/>For the books that can be found here, see Mad Mage Room Library.\nHouses the <a href=\"#/quest/mad-mage-room-quest\">Mad Mage Room Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4457ce097ff1bbc0f328dfa31c7eee43\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:148px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Old_madmage-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:96px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><img alt=\"Old days Mad Mage Room\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Old days Mad Mage Room\" height=\"146\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_madmage_588296.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Old madmage.gif (121 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old days Mad Mage Room</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:148px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Mad_mage_room_nowadays-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Nowadays Mad Mage Room\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Nowadays Mad Mage Room\" height=\"146\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mad_mage_room_nowadays_aaf95e.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Mad mage room nowadays.png (897 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbo